runs/20261013-four-seats/sources/linus/management-style.html:217:<section id="decisions">
runs/20261013-four-seats/sources/linus/management-style.html:218:<span id="id2"></span><h2>1) Decisions<a class="headerlink" href="#decisions" title="Permalink to this heading">¶</a></h2>
runs/20261013-four-seats/sources/linus/management-style.html:219:<p>Everybody thinks managers make decisions, and that decision-making is
